sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Cliente
    participant H as Handler HTTP
    participant S as Servicio
    participant D as decimal.Round
    participant B as big.Int

    C->>H: PUT price 1e100000000 (47 bytes)
    Note over H: decodifica el JSON<br/>valor=1, exp=100000000<br/>rapido y diminuto
    H->>S: SetProductPrice(price)
    S->>D: Round2(price)
    D->>B: calcular 10^100000000
    Note over B: reserva memoria para<br/>100 millones de digitos
    B-->>B: 25 s de CPU · 279 MiB
    Note over C,B: el cliente ya corto,<br/>la goroutine sigue trabajando
    B--xS: o el SO mata el contenedor (OOM)
    Note over S: ValidMoney nunca<br/>llego a ejecutarse
